<title>SPAIN: Spain to sell Aldeasa to institutions in Sept.</title>
<headline>Spain to sell Aldeasa to institutions in Sept.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish state holding company Seppa said on Wednesday it would float duty-free shop manager Aldeasa via a national and international institutional placement in September.</p>
<p>In a statement, Seppa said this would &quot;practically coincide&quot; with the public share offering of Endesa.</p>
</text>
